<p>Wa hijaba wa abbasa..(6)<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n</p> 
<p>zainab e muztar pukari shamiyo ke darmiya'n<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n</p> 
<p>Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade</p> 
<p>1. Zamine chadar banakar laayi thi ghar se jise<br> mai sadaye de rahi hu koi batla de use<br> sar khula hamsheer ka hai hone waali hai azaa'n<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade</p> 
<p>2. Wo amama ho rida ho sar se nisbat hai use<br> kaun hai ye saanha batlaye ab zainab kise<br> bhai ka sar meri chadar hai sare nauke sina<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade</p> 
<p>3. Haath se chehra chhupau ya ke dhaapu apna sar<br> tu madad kar ab ghareebo ki khuda e behrobar<br> haath kab azaad hai bandhi gayi hai rassiya'n<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade</p> 
<p>4. Tumko pala hai bade naazo se is dilgeer ne<br> dediya tha bachpane hi mein mujhe shabbir ne<br> aye ali akbar bata do tum to na lo imtehaa'n<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade</p> 
<p>5. Saaqiye kausar ka beta aur saqqa e haram<br> ye khabar aayi hai uske hogaye baazu qalam<br> maut hai sar par khadi aur le raha hai hichkiya'n<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade</p> 
<p>6. Qabr e asghar ki taraf rukh karke dukhiya ne kaha<br> ae mere kamsin mujahid ye mere sarki rida<br> shimr kaise cheen sakta tha jo tum hote jawa'n<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade</p> 
<p>7. Roohe zainab aajtak jis ghar pe rehan o raza<br> dekhti hai parchame abbas par doshe hawa<br> puchti hai wo kaha'n hai jiska parcham hai nishaa'n<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Meri chadar chhin rahi hai, karbala mein nagaha<br> hai mera bhai kaha'n<br> Mere ghazi tu meri chadar laade..(2)</p>